ff0000\"><b>16/05/2026</b></span></li>\n<li>Last Date Pay Exam Fee :<b>19/05/2026</b></li>\n<li>Exam Date: <strong>22/07/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Admit Card Available : <b>15/07/2026<br>\n</b></li>\n<li>Answer Key Available : <strong>30/07/2026</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"273\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Application Fee</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>General / OBC / EWS : <strong>Rs. 1100/-</strong></li>\n<li>SC / ST / PH : <strong>Rs. 550/-</strong></li>\n<li>Pay the Examination Fee Through Cast at E Challan or Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking<b> </b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Patna High Court Computer Operator Cum Typist Notification 2026 : <span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">Age Limit as on </span></b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>01/01/2026</b></span></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum Age :<strong> 18 Years</strong></li>\n<li>Maximum Age <strong> 37 Years for Male</strong></li>\n<li>Maximum Age <strong> 40 Years for Female</strong></li>\n<li>Age Relaxation Extra as per Patna High Court Computer Operator Cum Typist Recruitment Rules.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Patna High Court Computer Operator Cum Typist Recruitment 2026: <span style=\"color: #008000\">Vacancy Details </span></b><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Total : 48 Post</b></span></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Post Name</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"159\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Total Post</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Patna High Court Computer Operator Cum Typist Eligibility</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\n<p align=\"center\">Bihar Patna High Court PHC Computer Operator Cum Typist</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"159\">\n<p align=\"center\">48</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor Degree in in Any Stream from Any Recognized University</li>\n<li>Diploma/ Certificate of at least six month’s course in Computer Application</li>\n<li>Certificate in Typing proficiency of 40 words per minute in English and 30 words per minute in Hindi.</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\">\n\n<ul>\n<li>Patna High Court Computer Operator Cum Typist Recruitment for Various Post Candidate Can Apply Between <strong>17/04/2026 to 16/05/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in Patna High Court Computer Operator Cum Typist Recruitment 2026.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, <span style=\"color: #000000\"></span>, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n<li>For the latest updates on Sarkari Result, admit card, answer key, and result, always visit SarkariResult.com, the official website for Sarkari Result in India (Since 2012).</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"620\"><br>\n<!-- 300 x 250 mar 23 --><br>\n<br>\n\n     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});\n<p></p>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full Patna High Court Computer Operator Cum Typist Exam 2026 Notification Before